  state clean <<choice>>
  state room <<choice>>
  tipped --> tipped: a greasy pizza box
  tipped --> magnet: start the belt
  magnet --> jet: pull the cans
  jet --> screen: blow the bottles
  screen --> check: shake out the glass
  check --> clean: look
  clean --> baled: [only paper left]
  clean --> picking: [else]
